,"call_locator":"4ec3b4d0d95ed8e2e2251e6c010349588760e5ede94e8245349cbf7eb675af63","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b592dbbfe1322dace9a388c0a7efda5db4ab2f2b084314e5150657f09e9a60e2","logical_entry_identity":"09af43a80ce93d58405215f43fefeb1521925f87c726913a15d647dbeaddfc5b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Consume a soul to empower one of your skeleton, making it into a Lord of Skulls.\n\t\tThe Lord of Skulls gains %d more life and is instantly healed to full.\n\t\tThere can be only one active Lord of Skulls, casting this spell on another skeleton removes the effect from the current one.\n\t\tIt also gains a new talent if high enough:\n\t\tAt level 2 Warriors learn Giant Leap, a powerful jump attack that deals damage and dazes on impact and frees the skeleton from any stun, daze and pin effects they may have\n\t\tAt level 3 Archers learn Vital Shot, a devastating attack that can stun and cripple their foes\n\t\tAt level 5 Mages learn Meteoric Crash, a destructive spell that crushes and burns foes in a big radius for multiple turns and stuns them\n\t\tAt level 6 Bone Giants learn You Shall Be My Weapon!, a massive attack that deals high damage, knockbacks foes and stuns them\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"消耗一个灵魂强化你的一个骷髅，使其成为骷髅王。\n\t\t骷髅王额外获得 %d 点生命上限，并立即恢复全部生命。\n\t\t同时只能存在一个骷髅王；对另一个骷髅施放此法术会移除当前骷髅王的效果。\n\t\t技能等级足够高时，它还会获得新技能：\n\t\t- 技能等级 2 时，战士学会“巨人飞跃”，一个强力的跳跃攻击，会在落地时造成伤害并使敌人眩晕，还会解除骷髅身上的震慑、眩晕和定身效果。\n\t\t- 技能等级 3 时，弓箭手学会“要害射击”，一记毁灭性的攻击，能够震慑并致残敌人。\n\t\t- 技能等级 5 时，法师学会“落星”，一个毁灭性法术，会在大范围内碾压并灼烧敌人多个回合，同时震慑他们。\n\t\t- 技能等级 6 时，骨巨人学会“你将成为我的武器！”，一记威力巨大的攻击，会造成高额伤害、击退并震慑敌人。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7fd3dd820a1c36438b93064b866c419ed95ea3daead0499e1c07ec43d3145301","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b597c2032705ffeab08924a20f8f93d99a2fa8dcf89b5ee113c8dd4521cb30c4","logical_entry_identity":"c3ac62a53a588fa19c59d77630eca4afc2a949cd0645ae77ca36b0327cb6c2de","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This tall staff is tipped 